{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deliver to it beside the destinations that send events away, then read what arrived: an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-app event inspector or debug drawer listing what was just tracked, a recent-activity view,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a SwiftUI preview fed sample events, or a test checking what its code tracked."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let destination = try InMemoryDestination(capacity: 500)","let tracker = Tracker()","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","await tracker.finish()","try await tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: destination).execute()","destination.events(of: SignedUp.self)  \/\/ [SignedUp(plan: \"pro\")]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It keeps at most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" records, across batches: once a batch takes it past that, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oldest records are dropped until the newest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" remain. A batch some of whose records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"were dropped is kept with the newest of them, so "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/batches","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" always holds "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/unbounded()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps everything, for a run whose length the caller controls."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share what they keep: the copy the delivery holds and the one the app reads are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same log. Reading is safe from any thread while batches arrive."}]}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","title":"InMemoryDestination","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"externalID":"s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV","remoteSource":{"fileName":"InMemoryDestination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination.swift#L28"},"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A destination that keeps the newest records it receives, in memory, for the app to read.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/init()","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/init(capacity:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/batches","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/deliveries","doc:\/\/Destinations\/d